# Project - React + Gemini AI Component

Built with Vite, React, Tailwind CSS v4, and Google Gemini AI.

## Tech Stack

- **Vite** - Build tool
- **React** - UI
- **Tailwind CSS v4** - Styling (via @tailwindcss/vite)
- **@google/genai** - Gemini AI integration
- **@vitejs/plugin-react** - React plugin for Vite

## Setup Instructions

### 1. Install Dependencies
```bash
npm install

